---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const itemSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "Orange Julius Original",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/orange-julius.webp",
      "description": "Fresh orange juice blended with the original Julius creamy base into a smooth, frothy drink. Part OJ, part creamy smoothie — a DQ and Orange Julius brand original since 1926.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "3.99",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
        "url": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/items/orange-julius"
      },
      "nutrition": {
        "@type": "NutritionInformation",
        "calories": "~210 cal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much is an Orange Julius at DQ?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Small $3.99, Medium $4.49, Large $4.99. Prices may vary by location."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Orange Julius available at all Dairy Queen locations?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. Orange Julius is only available at DQ/Orange Julius combination locations and standalone Orange Julius stores. Use the DQ app to find a location near you."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does an Orange Julius taste like?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A smooth, frothy drink that combines fresh orange juice flavor with a light, creamy texture. It is not purely OJ — the Julius base creates an airy, almost milkshake-like consistency without dairy."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Orange Julius — Price, Calories 2026" description="DQ Orange Julius price: from $3.99, 210+ cal. Fresh orange juice blended with the original Julius base into a creamy, frothy drink. Available at select DQ...">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/drinks">Drinks</a></li><li aria-current="page">Orange Julius</li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/orange-julius.webp" alt="Orange Julius® Original — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Select DQ Locations</span><span class="badge">Creamy &amp; Frothy</span><span class="badge blue">~210 Cal Small</span></div>
      <h1>Orange Julius® Original</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">From $3.99</div>
      <p>Sun-drenched Valencia orange juice purees whipped with the legendary Julius velvety secret base and micro-chipped ice into an airy, frothy cloud. Part citrus splash, part creamy creamsicle dream—a historic American refreshment born in 1926, starting at $3.99 (~210 calories).</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>$3.99 (Small)</td></tr><tr><td>Calories (Small)</td><td>~210 cal</td></tr><tr><td>Flavors</td><td>Original OJ · Strawberry Banana · Tropical</td></tr><tr><td>Availability</td><td>Select DQ and DQ/Orange Julius locations</td></tr><tr><td>Brand History</td><td>Orange Julius brand since 1926, now owned by International Dairy Queen</td></tr></tbody></table>
