  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The 1926 Beverly Hills Citrus Legend</h2>
  <p>Predating the founding of Dairy Queen itself, the Orange Julius® began at a Los Angeles fruit stand in 1926 when Julius Freed's customers famously pleaded, "Make me a drink that doesn't upset my stomach!" By blending acidic citrus juice with a proprietary velvety egg-and-whey-free base powder, the beverage neutralized raw citrus bite into a smooth, micro-aerated foam. Acquired by Dairy Queen to expand premium fruit offerings, it remains a cherished retro American staple. Browse our complete drink catalog on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>Why It Transcends Standard Fruit Juice</h2>
  <p>Standard grocery store orange juice is sharp, thin, and watery. The Orange Julius elevates citrus into a dessert-adjacent indulgence: high-velocity blending creates a velvety, frothy suspension that sips like a melted orange creamsicle bar while retaining a clean, light finish at approximately 210 calories for a Small.</p>

  <h2>Orange Julius Flavors Available</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Flavor</th><th>Small Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Original Orange Julius</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~210</td><td>Classic OJ with the Julius creamy base</td></tr><tr><td>Strawberry Banana Julius</td><td class="price-cell">$4.29</td><td>~230</td><td>Strawberry + banana + Julius base</td></tr><tr><td>Tropical Julius (seasonal)</td><td class="price-cell">$4.29</td><td>~240</td><td>Tropical fruit blend + Julius base</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>How to Locate an Official Julius Counter</h2>
  <p>Because the specialized Julius whipping stations require distinct equipment, they are primarily featured in co-branded "DQ / Orange Julius" locations and vintage shopping center storefronts. Check your local restaurant via the store finder or mobile ordering app before making a dedicated trip. All pricing tiers and sizes are documented on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>Related Drinks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/fruit-smoothies">DQ Fruit Smoothies — from $3.99 (similar fruity drinks)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/misty-slush">Misty Slush — from $2.39 (lighter fruity option)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté — from $4.29 (creamy frozen coffee)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/drinks">Full DQ Drinks Menu</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
