      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Small $3.99, Medium $4.49, Large $4.99. Prices may vary by location.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is Orange Julius available at all Dairy Queen locations?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">No. Orange Julius is only available at DQ/Orange Julius combination locations and standalone Orange Julius stores. Use the DQ app to find a location near you.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What does an Orange Julius taste like?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">A smooth, frothy drink that combines fresh orange juice flavor with a light, creamy texture. It is not purely OJ — the Julius base creates an airy, almost milkshake-like consistency without dairy.</div></div>
    </div></div>
